RES osdtriplet
BES
CIR S2 8
CIR 9
SET CAP
BES
FIR
VIE ; GO
! ---- CODE V aperture commands: rectangle/ellipse, decenter, rotation,
! obscurations; saved and restored (the listing must not change).
RES osdtriplet
CIR S1 6
ADY S1 0.11
ADX S1 0.22
REX S2 4
REY S2 2
ARO S2 15
ELY OBS S4 1
ELX OBS S4 0.5
ADY OBS S4 0.2
CIR OBS S5 0.7
ADX OBS S5 0.02
CIR SI 9
SAV apsave
PRT apsave
RES apsave
SAV apsave2
PRT apsave2
! A +Y aperture decenter on the stop moves the pupil +Y
RES osdtriplet
CIR S3 2.5
ADY S3 1.5
RSI f1 w1 0 0.7
RSI f1 w1 0 -0.7
! Errors
ADX S3 1
REX S2
REX S99 1
